(7277017, 1132869, 177030, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and color choices although the halos bother me a bit. Can''t really tell if that is from post processed burning or part of the exposure. The blurred subject works well with motion of the umbrella.  One of very few intentionally blurry photos I have rated highly.</td>', 'Nice effect and color choices although the halos bother me a bit. Can''t really tell if that is from post processed burning or part of the exposure. The blurred subject works well with motion of the umbrella.  One of very few intentionally blurry photos I have rated highly.', '2014-10-24 17:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
