(7277124, 1133268, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but wish the umbrella was a little less obscured. As it stands, the frame is the center of attention, not the brolly.</td>', 'Nice composition, but wish the umbrella was a little less obscured. As it stands, the frame is the center of attention, not the brolly.', '2014-10-25 12:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
