(7277156, 1133253, 68504, '<td valign="top">what saves this from cliche are the dynamics of the details, the solidity of the composition and the understated tones. (and this itself is an understatement). I feel that every detail in the water has been relished for what it is.</td>', 'what saves this from cliche are the dynamics of the details, the solidity of the composition and the understated tones. (and this itself is an understatement). I feel that every detail in the water has been relished for what it is.', '2014-10-25 16:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
