(7278192, 1132765, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the textures.  And while I love the additional umbrellas in the background, something about the spacing feels not quite right - like I either want to see more or less of them, but not that much.  Still very good.  7</td>', 'Love the textures.  And while I love the additional umbrellas in the background, something about the spacing feels not quite right - like I either want to see more or less of them, but not that much.  Still very good.  7', '2014-10-29 15:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
