(7278247, 1133068, 136989, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines and it certainly evokes emotion.  The trees are like protectors guarding the realm of the fallen.  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Great leading lines and it certainly evokes emotion.  The trees are like protectors guarding the realm of the fallen.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2014-10-30 02:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
