(7278266, 1133315, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here and the harshness goes well with the broken umbrella.</td>', 'I like the colors here and the harshness goes well with the broken umbrella.', '2014-10-30 08:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278267, 1133331, 13077, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if that''s a really big umbrella or if it''s just something about the lo-fi sort of way you shot it that makes a normal sized one look big.<br/>I like the photo though.</td>', 'I can''t tell if that''s a really big umbrella or if it''s just something about the lo-fi sort of way you shot it that makes a normal sized one look big.I like the photo though.', '2014-10-30 08:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278268, 1133225, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, quite a crowd. I like how the two umbrellas in the center almost look like snow-peaked mountains. I also like how it''s an old fashioned looking photo but people are wearing modern clothes.</td>', 'Wow, quite a crowd. I like how the two umbrellas in the center almost look like snow-peaked mountains. I also like how it''s an old fashioned looking photo but people are wearing modern clothes.', '2014-10-30 08:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278270, 1133207, 13077, '<td valign="top">It might be a while!<br/>Very nice, well composed and good job handling the glare from the sun and still getting some detail in the lady and dog.</td>', 'It might be a while!Very nice, well composed and good job handling the glare from the sun and still getting some detail in the lady and dog.', '2014-10-30 08:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278271, 1133292, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful umbrella, and good choice of angles and lighting to photograph it with.</td>', 'Beautiful umbrella, and good choice of angles and lighting to photograph it with.', '2014-10-30 08:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278272, 1133330, 13077, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, electricity and rain don''t really mix too well do they?</td>', 'Not a bad idea, electricity and rain don''t really mix too well do they?', '2014-10-30 08:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278274, 1133283, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty, but unfortunately the light colored dessert really blends in with the light colored dish and the background and makes it hard to see. Also, a little more depth of field to make the entire umbrellas sharp would have been nice.</td>', 'Looks tasty, but unfortunately the light colored dessert really blends in with the light colored dish and the background and makes it hard to see. Also, a little more depth of field to make the entire umbrellas sharp would have been nice.', '2014-10-30 09:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278275, 1133242, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured. Really illustrates a gray, rainy day very well.</td>', 'Nicely captured. Really illustrates a gray, rainy day very well.', '2014-10-30 09:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278278, 1133251, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Well composed, I like the way all the elements interact, and the colors are nice.</td>', 'Interesting photo. Well composed, I like the way all the elements interact, and the colors are nice.', '2014-10-30 09:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
