(7278472, 1133242, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nice ribbon Henry. Good shot too which I didn''t vote on - nor any other either. Regretfully. No sense of time any more. I think I told you I rented studio space long ago just off Grand St - actually on Chrystie St. so we have trod along the same pavements decades apart.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-10-31 00:11:03.</i></td>', 'Nice ribbon Henry. Good shot too which I didn''t vote on - nor any other either. Regretfully. No sense of time any more. I think I told you I rented studio space long ago just off Grand St - actually on Chrystie St. so we have trod along the same pavements decades apart.', '2014-10-31 00:09:48.000000', '2014-10-31 00:11:03.000000', 0),
