(7278497, 1133225, 97225, '<td valign="top">Quote <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a><i>Funny how we both finished near each other, and we both had beach umbrellas in our photos.</i> <br/> <br/>Yes! I guess there are as many beach umbrellas in Australia as the other kind. Some of my outtakes are possibly even more like yours. <br/>You had me guessing which Aussie had entered yours, but that just goes to show that trying to tie identity to location can be misleading.</td>', 'Quote  NeatFunny how we both finished near each other, and we both had beach umbrellas in our photos.  Yes! I guess there are as many beach umbrellas in Australia as the other kind. Some of my outtakes are possibly even more like yours. You had me guessing which Aussie had entered yours, but that just goes to show that trying to tie identity to location can be misleading.', '2014-10-31 01:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
